      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Performance\n\n- Fetch visible range, not all events\n- Prefetch adjacent day/week/month\n- Normalize entities\n- Memoize visible event selectors\n- Avoid global writes on every drag frame\n- Use requestAnimationFrame for drag/resize\n- Virtualize agenda/search/attendee lists\n- Compress API responses",
      "originalText": "Performance\n\n- Fetch visible range, not all events\n- Prefetch adjacent day/week/month\n- Normalize entities\n- Memoize visible event selectors\n- Avoid global writes on every drag frame\n- Use requestAnimationFrame for drag/resize\n- Virtualize agenda/search/attendee lists\n- Compress API responses",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 229
    },
