      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Observability\n\n- Initial calendar load time\n- View switch latency\n- Event create/update latency\n- Conflict-check latency\n- API error rate by endpoint\n- Long browser task count\n- Offline queue failure rate\n- Never log private titles or attendees",
