      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Staff-level summary\n\nThe frontend owns user trust.\n\nA strong design treats time correctness, collaboration, privacy, accessibility, observability, and performance as first-class architecture constraints — not afterthoughts.",
      "originalText": "Staff-level summary\n\nThe frontend owns user trust.\n\nA strong design treats time correctness, collaboration, privacy, accessibility, observability, and performance as first-class architecture constraints — not afterthoughts.",
